<?php
declare(strict_types=1);
namespace CocTracker;

/** Search-facing calculator copy; describes the implemented model, not live combat guarantees. */
final class SeoZapquake
{
    public const UPDATED='2026-11-05';
    public static function feature(string $lang): array
    {
        $en=$lang==='en';
        return [
            'title'=>$en?'CoC Zapquake Calculator: Lightning, Earthquake and hero equipment':'Kalkulator Zapquake CoC: Lightning, Earthquake dan hero equipment',
            'intro'=>$en?'Find minimum-slot Lightning and Earthquake combinations for Clash of Clans defenses and heroes. Set attacker and defender Town Hall presets, equipment and battle modifiers in ClanIntel.':'Cari kombinasi Lightning dan Earthquake dengan slot spell minimum untuk bangunan dan hero Clash of Clans. Atur TH penyerang, TH bertahan, equipment, dan modifier di ClanIntel.',
            'updated'=>self::UPDATED,'icon'=>'icon-swords.webp','tool'=>'zapquake','toolPath'=>'/tools/zapquake','guide'=>'zapquake',
            'cta'=>$en?'Open Zapquake Calculator':'Buka Kalkulator Zapquake',
            'sections'=>$en?[
                ['Find a minimum-slot spell combination','Choose Lightning and Earthquake levels, a spell capacity and the maximum number of each spell. Search evaluates the permitted combinations and recommends the lowest spell-slot cost, using overkill to break ties. Equipment you select is required to hit the target; its contribution is not a free spell or a spell-capacity charge. Use Simulation details to inspect alternatives and the ordered damage timeline.'],
                ['Separate attacker TH from defender TH','Attacker Town Hall limits spell levels and supported equipment according to Hero Hall and Blacksmith requirements. Defender Town Hall filters target buildings and caps their levels; hero level caps follow Hero Hall. Changing the defender preset starts targets at that TH maximum. Post-merge counts are used where available, so a removed or fully merged building can disappear. Manual mode keeps legacy targets available for bases that have not completed those changes.'],
                ['Include hero equipment and repeated earthquake hits','The calculator supports Earthquake Boots, Electro Boots, Fireball, Giant Arrow, Spiky Ball, Seeking Shield, Rocket Backpack and Flame Blower. Select only effects that hit this target, then set their levels and activation times. Earthquake Boots and Earthquake Spell share a repeated-hit counter with divisors 1, 3, 5 and so on. Their order changes estimated damage; Electro Boots uses explicit contact-duration ticks.'],
                ['Check buildings, Town Hall, Clan Castle and heroes','Cards show target level, HP and an estimated combination. Lightning does not damage Town Hall or Clan Castle. Air heroes are unaffected by Earthquake. Archer Queen, Barbarian King and Royal Champion use a fixed ground type; Dragon Duke and Minion Prince use air. Only Grand Warden needs a ground/air choice. Results remain subject to target eligibility for the selected equipment.'],
                ['Apply dated battle conditions without hiding assumptions','Normal, Ranked League, CWL, Friendly, Esports and Custom profiles are available within their supported dates. League bonuses can affect defending hero HP without changing building HP. Open target details for manual healing, supercharged HP or an activated Town Hall weapon. These inputs are explicit: the calculator does not read a player base or automatically determine seasonal bonuses.'],
                ['Understand the data and simulation limits','The tool uses a versioned reference dataset and a separate calculation model. It needs no player tag, game login or player-profile API request. The active data and model versions are visible on the page. All selected hits must land on one target; movement, radius and target selection are outside the simulation. Internal game rounding is not fully verified, so a narrow damage margin should be treated as an estimate.'],
            ]:[
                ['Cari kombinasi dengan slot spell minimum','Pilih level Lightning dan Earthquake, kapasitas spell, serta batas jumlah masing-masing spell. Pencarian memeriksa kombinasi yang diizinkan dan merekomendasikan biaya slot terendah, lalu memakai sisa damage sebagai pembeda jika biayanya sama. Equipment terpilih wajib mengenai target; kontribusinya bukan spell gratis atau pemakaian kapasitas spell. Buka Detail simulasi untuk melihat alternatif dan urutan damage.'],
                ['Pisahkan TH penyerang dan TH bertahan','TH penyerang membatasi level spell dan equipment yang didukung berdasarkan persyaratan Hero Hall serta Blacksmith. TH bertahan menyaring bangunan dan membatasi level target; batas hero mengikuti Hero Hall. Mengubah preset bertahan mengatur level awal target ke maksimum TH tersebut. Jumlah bangunan setelah penggabungan digunakan jika tersedia, sehingga bangunan yang dihapus atau seluruhnya digabung dapat hilang dari daftar. Mode Manual menyediakan target lama untuk base yang belum selesai mengalami perubahan tersebut.'],
                ['Perhitungkan hero equipment dan hit gempa berulang','Equipment yang didukung meliputi Earthquake Boots, Electro Boots, Fireball, Giant Arrow, Spiky Ball, Seeking Shield, Rocket Backpack, dan Flame Blower. Pilih hanya efek yang mengenai target, lalu atur level dan waktu aktivasi. Earthquake Boots serta Earthquake Spell berbagi penghitung hit dengan pembagi 1, 3, 5, dan seterusnya. Urutan keduanya memengaruhi estimasi damage; Electro Boots dihitung melalui tick selama durasi kontak yang diisi.'],
                ['Periksa bangunan, Town Hall, Clan Castle dan hero','Kartu menampilkan level target, HP, serta estimasi kombinasi. Lightning tidak merusak Town Hall atau Clan Castle. Hero udara tidak terkena Earthquake. Archer Queen, Barbarian King, dan Royal Champion otomatis bertipe darat; Dragon Duke serta Minion Prince bertipe udara. Hanya Grand Warden yang memerlukan pilihan darat/udara. Hasil tetap mengikuti kelayakan target untuk equipment yang dipilih.'],
                ['Gunakan kondisi pertempuran bertanggal dengan asumsi yang jelas','Profil Normal, Ranked League, CWL, Friendly, Esports, dan Custom tersedia dalam rentang tanggal yang didukung. Bonus liga dapat memengaruhi HP hero bertahan tanpa mengubah HP bangunan. Buka detail target untuk healing manual, HP supercharge, atau senjata Town Hall aktif. Nilai-nilai tersebut diisi eksplisit; kalkulator tidak membaca base pemain atau menentukan bonus musiman secara otomatis.'],
                ['Pahami data dan batas simulasi','Alat memakai dataset referensi berversi dan model perhitungan terpisah. Tidak diperlukan tag pemain, login game, atau permintaan API profil pemain. Versi data dan model aktif dapat dilihat pada halaman. Seluruh hit terpilih harus mengenai satu target; gerakan, radius, dan pemilihan target tidak disimulasikan. Pembulatan internal game belum sepenuhnya terverifikasi, sehingga hasil dengan selisih damage tipis tetap merupakan estimasi.'],
            ],
            'steps'=>$en?['Set attacker TH, Lightning and Earthquake levels, then choose equipment that will hit.','Select defender TH or Manual, then find a building or hero and choose its level.','Review the minimum-slot result; open Simulation details to test a specific combination and inspect the timeline.','Apply a supported battle profile and recheck effective HP, target eligibility and the remaining damage margin.']:['Atur TH penyerang, level Lightning dan Earthquake, lalu pilih equipment yang akan mengenai target.','Pilih TH bertahan atau Manual, cari bangunan atau hero, kemudian tentukan levelnya.','Periksa hasil slot minimum; buka Detail simulasi untuk menguji kombinasi tertentu dan melihat timeline.','Terapkan profil pertempuran yang didukung dan periksa kembali HP efektif, kelayakan target, serta selisih damage.'],
        ];
    }
    public static function guide(string $lang): array
    {
        $en=$lang==='en';
        return ['title'=>$en?'Zapquake guide: calculate Lightning, Earthquake and Earthquake Boots damage':'Panduan Zapquake: menghitung damage Lightning, Earthquake dan Earthquake Boots',
            'intro'=>$en?'Learn how spell levels, maximum HP, repeated earthquake hits and equipment timing affect a Zapquake calculation. Read results with Town Hall presets and modifier limits in context.':'Pelajari pengaruh level spell, HP maksimum, hit gempa berulang, dan timing equipment pada perhitungan Zapquake. Baca hasil dengan konteks preset TH serta batas modifier.',
            'updated'=>self::UPDATED,'tool'=>'zapquake','toolPath'=>'/tools/zapquake',
            'sections'=>$en?[
                ['How Lightning and Earthquake contribute damage','Lightning contributes a fixed amount from its selected level. Earthquake uses a percentage of maximum target HP, not the current HP remaining. The first effective quake hit uses its full percentage, the second is divided by 3, the third by 5, and subsequent hits use the following odd divisors. Separate percentages apply to buildings and eligible ground heroes. Earthquake levels 1-5 do not damage ground heroes in this dataset; air heroes receive no earthquake damage.'],
                ['Why Earthquake Boots order matters','Earthquake Boots shares the same repeated-quake counter with Earthquake Spell. A Boots hit before a spell receives the first divisor; a later hit may receive a reduced share. Set activation time and equal-time equipment priority to model your intended order. The model keeps this counter between hits even if healing occurs. Equipment selection means a confirmed hit on this target, not a claim that radius or movement will make it connect.'],
                ['A worked reference example','With an 800 HP level-1 Air Defense, level-1 Lightning dealing 150 damage and level-8 Earthquake dealing 29% building damage, one Earthquake first deals 232. Four Lightning add 600, giving 832 damage and a 32 HP margin. This costs five spell slots. The example uses no equipment, healing or extra HP modifiers and assumes every spell hits. It illustrates the pinned reference values, not a universal solution for every Air Defense.'],
                ['Read search and test modes differently','Catalog cards search within the selected capacity and spell-count limits. A result without a solution does not prove a target can never be destroyed: inspect immunity, available spell levels, required equipment and your limits. In Simulation details, Test my combination evaluates the counts you enter. Spell order and time intervals can change the result when equipment or healing is involved.'],
                ['Check effective HP and source coverage','Defender TH presets describe post-merge availability, while attacker TH limits your offensive choices. Dated Ranked/CWL profiles can alter defending hero HP. A manual supercharge value is total HP, not an additional amount; seasonal effects require explicit custom inputs when no verified preset exists. Check the visible dataset and rule-profile versions. A calculated survival or overkill near zero remains sensitive to model rounding and hit assumptions.'],
            ]:[
                ['Kontribusi damage Lightning dan Earthquake','Lightning memberi damage tetap dari level yang dipilih. Earthquake memakai persentase HP maksimum target, bukan HP yang masih tersisa. Hit gempa efektif pertama memakai persentase penuh, hit kedua dibagi 3, hit ketiga dibagi 5, dan berikutnya memakai pembagi ganjil selanjutnya. Persentase bangunan dan hero darat yang memenuhi syarat berbeda. Pada dataset ini Earthquake level 1-5 tidak merusak hero darat; hero udara tidak menerima damage gempa.'],
                ['Mengapa urutan Earthquake Boots berpengaruh','Earthquake Boots berbagi penghitung hit gempa dengan Earthquake Spell. Boots yang mengenai target sebelum spell memperoleh pembagi pertama; hit yang lebih akhir dapat menerima pengurangan. Atur waktu aktivasi dan prioritas equipment pada waktu yang sama untuk memodelkan urutan serangan. Penghitung tetap berlanjut meskipun healing terjadi di antara hit. Equipment terpilih berarti hit dikonfirmasi mengenai target, bukan jaminan bahwa radius atau gerak hero membuatnya terkena.'],
                ['Contoh perhitungan dari data referensi','Untuk Air Defense level 1 dengan 800 HP, Lightning level 1 berdamage 150, dan Earthquake level 8 berdamage bangunan 29%, satu Earthquake lebih dahulu memberi 232 damage. Empat Lightning menambah 600, sehingga totalnya 832 dengan selisih 32 HP. Kombinasi ini memakai lima slot spell. Contoh tidak memakai equipment, healing, atau modifier HP tambahan dan mengasumsikan semua spell mengenai target. Angka ini menggambarkan nilai referensi yang dikunci, bukan solusi universal untuk semua Air Defense.'],
                ['Bedakan mode pencarian dan pengujian','Kartu katalog mencari kombinasi dalam batas kapasitas dan jumlah spell yang dipilih. Hasil tanpa solusi tidak membuktikan target mustahil dihancurkan: periksa immunity, level spell, equipment wajib, dan batas pilihan. Pada Detail simulasi, Uji kombinasi saya mengevaluasi jumlah spell yang Anda masukkan. Urutan spell dan jeda waktu dapat mengubah hasil jika equipment atau healing dilibatkan.'],
                ['Periksa HP efektif dan cakupan sumber','Preset TH bertahan menggambarkan ketersediaan setelah penggabungan, sedangkan TH penyerang membatasi pilihan serangan. Profil Ranked/CWL bertanggal dapat mengubah HP hero bertahan. Nilai supercharge manual adalah HP total, bukan tambahan HP; efek musiman memakai input Custom jika belum ada preset terverifikasi. Periksa versi dataset serta profil aturan yang terlihat. Sisa HP atau overkill mendekati nol tetap sensitif terhadap pembulatan model dan asumsi hit.'],
            ],
            'sourceLabel'=>$en?'Pinned reference dataset':'Dataset referensi yang dikunci',
            'source'=>['clash-of-clans-data (community source)','https://github.com/chiefpansancolt/clash-of-clans-data/tree/431f8da169ba93b730d182dfec0ca4820998db0d/data/home'],
        ];
    }
    public static function questions(string $lang): array
    {
        return $lang==='en'?[
            ['What is a Zapquake calculator?','It estimates combinations of Lightning and Earthquake spells, with optional hero equipment, against one building or hero target. ClanIntel searches for minimum spell-slot cost within your limits.'],
            ['Do I need a player tag or game login?','No. Choose spell levels, equipment, target levels and battle conditions manually. The calculator does not read a player base or require game credentials.'],
            ['Does Earthquake Boots share diminishing returns with Earthquake Spell?','Yes. Both use the same repeated-quake counter in hit order, with divisors 1, 3, 5 and so on. Activation timing can change estimated damage.'],
            ['Can Lightning destroy Town Hall or Clan Castle?','Lightning does not damage either target. The calculator applies that immunity and evaluates the other permitted damage sources.'],
        ]:[
            ['Apa itu kalkulator Zapquake?','Alat ini mengestimasi kombinasi spell Lightning dan Earthquake, dengan hero equipment opsional, terhadap satu bangunan atau hero. ClanIntel mencari biaya slot spell minimum dalam batas pilihan Anda.'],
            ['Apakah perlu tag pemain atau login game?','Tidak. Level spell, equipment, level target, dan kondisi pertempuran dipilih manual. Kalkulator tidak membaca base pemain atau meminta kredensial game.'],
            ['Apakah Earthquake Boots berbagi pengurangan damage dengan Earthquake Spell?','Ya. Keduanya memakai penghitung gempa yang sama sesuai urutan hit, dengan pembagi 1, 3, 5, dan seterusnya. Waktu aktivasi dapat mengubah estimasi damage.'],
            ['Apakah Lightning bisa menghancurkan Town Hall atau Clan Castle?','Lightning tidak merusak kedua target tersebut. Kalkulator menerapkan immunity ini dan memeriksa sumber damage lain yang memenuhi syarat.'],
        ];
    }
    public static function decorate(string $html,string $lang,string $origin): string
    {
        $feature=self::feature($lang);$escape=static fn(string $v):string=>htmlspecialchars($v,ENT_QUOTES|ENT_SUBSTITUTE,'UTF-8');$en=$lang==='en';
        $url=$origin.'/tools/zapquake?lang='.$lang;
        $section='<section class="zap-panel zap-seo-content" aria-labelledby="zapSeoTitle"><h2 id="zapSeoTitle">'.$escape($en?'Plan Lightning, Earthquake and equipment damage':'Rencanakan damage Lightning, Earthquake dan equipment').'</h2><p>'.$escape($feature['intro']).'</p><ol>';
        foreach($feature['steps'] as $step)$section.='<li>'.$escape($step).'</li>';
        $section.='</ol><h3>'.($en?'Zapquake questions':'Pertanyaan tentang Zapquake').'</h3>';
        foreach(self::questions($lang) as [$q,$a])$section.='<details><summary>'.$escape($q).'</summary><p>'.$escape($a).'</p></details>';
        $section.='<p><a href="/features/zapquake-calculator?lang='.$lang.'">'.($en?'Explore calculator features':'Kenali fitur kalkulator').'</a> · <a href="/guides/zapquake?lang='.$lang.'">'.($en?'Read the Zapquake calculation guide':'Baca panduan perhitungan Zapquake').'</a></p></section>';
        $html=preg_replace_callback('~</main>~i',static fn()=>$section.'</main>',$html,1);
        $schema=['@context'=>'https://schema.org','@type'=>'WebApplication','name'=>$en?'Zapquake Calculator - ClanIntel':'Kalkulator Zapquake - ClanIntel','url'=>$url,'description'=>$feature['intro'],'inLanguage'=>$lang,'applicationCategory'=>'GameApplication','operatingSystem'=>'Web','dateModified'=>self::UPDATED,'featureList'=>array_column($feature['sections'],0),'publisher'=>['@type'=>'Organization','name'=>'ClanIntel']];
        return str_replace('</head>','<script type="application/ld+json">'.json_encode($schema,JSON_HEX_TAG|JSON_HEX_AMP|JSON_HEX_APOS|JSON_HEX_QUOT|JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE|JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR).'</script></head>',$html);
    }
}
